### status: illustrative-only
### public: false
### authRequired: true
### sessionAuthRequired: true
### tenantScopedHeadersRequired: false
### destructive: true
### requiresTenantHeaders: false
### llmOperational: false
### referenceOnly: true
### runtimeRecordConfirmed: false
### selectorConfirmed: true
### publishedBackendConfirmed: false
### knownPublishedFailure: false
### accessMode: authenticated-session
### selectionGuidance: reference-only-bulk-execution
### note: P3 PER_ITEM_UPDATE variant. Shared proposal/execution reads and cancellation are in the uniform journey; use real approved versions and IDs.

@baseUrl = https://praxis-api-quickstart.onrender.com
@bearerToken = replace-with-authorized-token
@xsrfToken = replace-with-XSRF-TOKEN-cookie-value-when-csrf-enabled
@idempotencyKey = replace-with-one-stable-client-key-for-items

### When CSRF is enabled, GET /actuator/health first, verify its Set-Cookie XSRF-TOKEN response header, and retain that cookie. Copy that raw cookie value into xsrfToken; keep the cookie and matching header on every POST. Bearer authentication and current grants remain required. Omit the CSRF cookie/header lines only when the host disables CSRF.
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### Evaluate the per-item proposal after the CSRF cookie is available.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/operations/missao-participantes/bulk/update-items/evaluation
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
Cookie: XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrfToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}

< ../../payloads/operations/missao_participantes_bulk_items_evaluation.json

### Review every proposal page through /bulk/proposals/{proposalId}/results before this confirmation.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/operations/missao-participantes/bulk/update-items
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
Cookie: XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrfToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}

< ../../payloads/operations/missao_participantes_bulk_items_confirmation.json
